WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
I am a fisherman from Houhai Village

2
00:00:01,400 --> 00:00:02,920
I go to sea more than a dozen times every month

3
00:00:03,120 --> 00:00:04,040
Just leftovers from before

4
00:00:04,040 --> 00:00:05,360
They are all sold to the leftover rice from our village.

5
00:00:05,560 --> 00:00:06,560
Iron Rooster, do you know?

6
00:00:06,760 --> 00:00:09,520
Hei Buliuqiu, the one with short hair, as for my skin color

7
00:00:09,720 --> 00:00:11,320
I haven’t been able to tan since I was a kid, and there’s nothing I can do about it.

8
00:00:11,640 --> 00:00:12,640
Because of this, the villagers

9
00:00:12,800 --> 00:00:15,080
Everyone laughs at me for being a pretty boy, right? That’s great

10
00:00:15,280 --> 00:00:17,200
Only pretty women like you if you don’t get tanned

11
00:00:17,560 --> 00:00:18,920
Brother, what price do you want to sell it for?

12
00:00:19,200 --> 00:00:21,600
Boss, what you said is interesting. From ancient times to the present,

13
00:00:21,760 --> 00:00:23,760
It's all buyers who bid and fishermen who counter-offer.

14
00:00:23,960 --> 00:00:26,560
Why are you doing the opposite? Could it be that

15
00:00:26,720 --> 00:00:29,040
Are you still suspecting that I'm just a bastard trying to lower the price?

16
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:30,960
Brothers joking

17
00:00:31,160 --> 00:00:32,480
I'm a serious student

18
00:00:32,640 --> 00:00:35,800
How can you suppress your price if you are the main business owner?

19
00:00:35,960 --> 00:00:37,880
If the hair is under 30 centimeters, it will be longer than 30 centimeters.

20
00:00:38,040 --> 00:00:39,160
I'll give you one dollar, buddy.

21
00:00:39,360 --> 00:00:40,680
How about it? Interesting enough?

22
00:00:45,070 --> 00:00:46,190
what do you mean

23
00:00:46,390 --> 00:00:48,670
A bunch of peonies smoked cigarettes for one dollar and I smoked one of yours

24
00:00:48,830 --> 00:00:49,870
Brother, take five cents

25
00:00:50,030 --> 00:00:51,110
It's raining and the boat is slipping

26
00:00:51,310 --> 00:00:53,230
When you go down, be careful not to fall.

27
00:00:53,390 --> 00:00:54,510
Brother, what are you doing?

28
00:00:54,870 --> 00:00:56,070
If you are not satisfied with the price

29
00:00:56,230 --> 00:00:58,190
Can we talk again? I just want to talk.

30
00:00:58,470 --> 00:00:59,990
But brother, you’ve been testing me over and over again.

31
00:01:00,150 --> 00:01:02,790
You don’t really mean to talk to me about business, brother.

32
00:01:03,190 --> 00:01:05,710
It was all my brother's fault just now, so why don't I give you some more?

33
00:01:05,870 --> 00:01:07,910
How about I tell you that a typhoon is coming soon?

34
00:01:08,070 --> 00:01:09,910
The other fish and rice people have already gone to the entire pier.

35
00:01:10,070 --> 00:01:12,990
Now I'm the only one left to collect the fish. Please tell me the price first.

36
00:01:13,690 --> 00:01:14,810
One piece under thirty centimeters

37
00:01:14,970 --> 00:01:16,090
Thirty to fifty-one-two

38
00:01:16,290 --> 00:01:18,730
Over fifty, I'll give you the price of one dollar and a half

39
00:01:18,890 --> 00:01:20,850
It's a bit higher than the purchase price of Iron Rooster.

40
00:01:21,130 --> 00:01:23,610
This man tried again and again to test that he was too naughty.

41
00:01:23,850 --> 00:01:24,890
But now the typhoon is coming

42
00:01:25,090 --> 00:01:28,650
It’s business to quickly grab the fish. There is no other fish rice on the pier for a while.

43
00:01:29,090 --> 00:01:32,010
Okay, the deal is done. I'll call the guy to come over and buy fish from Taiwan.

44
00:01:32,170 --> 00:01:33,890
Don't worry, there are still good things in the cabin.
